\centering
\includegraphics[width=0.75\linewidth,height=\textheight,keepaspectratio,alt={'Dissemination` depicts the essential component of developing a curated collection that communicates priority areas to collector crews for more targeted collection. These activities support the potential for increases in agricultural or propagative production of collected germplasm and the selection of materials for restoration plantings. safeHavens can be used to guide eSTZ study collections, while both packages are used for dissemination, collections, and restoration. By Emily Woodworth.}]{safeHavens-and-eSTZwritR-R-packages-for-prioritizing-germplasm-collections-for-restoration-and-conservation_files/figures/Wu-naut.jpg}
\caption{'Dissemination` depicts the essential component of developing a
curated collection that communicates priority areas to collector crews
for more targeted collection. These activities support the potential for
increases in agricultural or propagative production of collected
germplasm and the selection of materials for restoration plantings.
safeHavens can be used to guide eSTZ study collections, while both
packages are used for dissemination, collections, and restoration. By
